@@ -0,0 +1,26 @@
+# CampusIQ relational schema
+
+CampusIQ uses SQLAlchemy models that work with PostgreSQL in Docker and SQLite for a zero-setup local demonstration. `backend/app/models.py` is the executable schema source; tables are created at startup for the MVP. Production environments should add Alembic migrations before schema changes.
+
+| Table | Purpose | Privacy note |
+|---|---|---|
+| `users`, `roles` | Institution-provisioned accounts, role assignments and API permissions | Demo accounts are passwordless; institution passwords are PBKDF2-hashed. |
+| `buildings`, `floors` | Campus map, capacity, floor populations and operational state | Values are aggregate counts. |
+| `rooms`, `timetables` | Classrooms, labs, schedules, capacity and anonymous occupancy | No student-level attendance records. |
+| `cameras`, `camera_events` | Source configuration, health and anonymous detection aggregates | RTSP source URLs are Fernet-encrypted in the database and never serialized in API responses; `CAMPUSIQ_SECRET_KEY` must remain stable. |
+| `occupancy_records`, `campus_metrics` | Time-stamped occupancy, entry/exit and campus population history | Aggregates only; no person-level tracking. |
+| `parking_zones`, `parking_slots` | Zone totals and individual available/occupied/reserved/disabled spaces | No plates, vehicle IDs or vehicle histories. |
+| `vehicle_snapshots` | Time-stamped aggregate car and bike counts by zone | Class totals only; no plates or vehicle identifiers are stored. |
+| `events` | Venue schedule, capacity and anonymous crowd estimate | Crowd counts only. |
+| `alerts`, `restricted_zones` | Operational safety signals and normalized restricted-area polygons | Alerts describe a location/time, not an identified individual. |
+| `facilities`, `resources` | Facility occupancy and shared resource state | Aggregate utilization. |
+| `app_settings` | Demo state, retention preference and privacy switches | Deployment configuration must follow institutional policy. |
+
+## Relationships
+
+- `buildings` 1—N `floors`, `rooms`, `cameras`, `facilities`, `resources`, `events`, and `restricted_zones`.
+- `rooms` 1—N `timetables`; `cameras` 1—N `camera_events`.
+- `parking_zones` 1—N `parking_slots` and `vehicle_snapshots`.
+- `campus_metrics` and `occupancy_records` are timestamped history tables.
+
+Database connection selection uses `DATABASE_URL`. Omit it for `sqlite:///./campusiq.db`; Docker Compose configures `postgresql+psycopg://…`.
