+    </section><aside className="assistant-side-column"><section className="panel assistant-capability-panel"><div className="assistant-side-heading"><div><span className="panel-kicker">CONNECTED DATA</span><h3>Campus context</h3></div><span className="assistant-context-dot" /></div><div className="assistant-context-metric"><span className="assistant-context-icon"><Users2 size={16} /></span><span><small>Campus population</small><strong>{formatNumber(total)}</strong></span><em>live</em></div><div className="assistant-context-metric"><span className="assistant-context-icon context-rooms"><Building2 size={16} /></span><span><small>Rooms available</small><strong>{snapshot!.metrics.freeClassrooms}</strong></span><em>now</em></div><div className="assistant-context-metric"><span className="assistant-context-icon context-parking"><CarFront size={16} /></span><span><small>Parking spaces</small><strong>{formatNumber(snapshot!.metrics.parkingAvailable)}</strong></span><em>free</em></div><div className="assistant-context-metric"><span className="assistant-context-icon context-events"><Clock3 size={16} /></span><span><small>Events active</small><strong>{snapshot!.metrics.activeEvents}</strong></span><em>live</em></div><div className="assistant-context-footer"><span className="table-live-dot" />Context refreshes continuously with campus telemetry.</div></section><section className="panel assistant-help-panel"><div className="assistant-help-icon"><CircleHelp size={17} /></div><h3>Ask it like a colleague</h3><p>Use natural language to get a quick, grounded read on what is happening around campus.</p><div className="assistant-example-list"><span>“Which areas are above 80%?”</span><span>“Show active events today.”</span><span>“Where can I fit 50 people?”</span></div></section><div className="assistant-privacy-panel"><LockKeyhole size={14} /><span>Queries stay inside this CampusIQ backend. Answers use anonymous counts — not identities or biometrics.</span></div></aside></div>
+  </div>
+}
